{"id":"61f71a91e63627ba","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-compcode.md","title":"Computation Code","display":"df-compcode — Computation Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-compcode","aliases":["90-df-compcode"],"display":"df-compcode — Computation Code","depends_on":["[[90-df-configuration]]","[[90-df-sequence]]","[[90-df-turing-machine]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-compcode"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-compcode</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compcode — Computation Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-compcode-—-Computation-Code-($\\mathrm{CompCode}$)\">df-compcode — Computation Code (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCode}\\)</span>)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；数值序列操作见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4293e1643a9254d8\" href=\"?note=4293e1643a9254d8\" title=\"90-df-sequence\">90-df-sequence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}\">\\(M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}\\)</span> 全部取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>；配置对象见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3953b8fffc6e6551\" href=\"?note=3953b8fffc6e6551\" title=\"90-df-configuration\">90-df-configuration</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\ \\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(y)_0=\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(\\operatorname{Init}(e,\\vec x))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)-1\\ \\operatorname{CStep}(e,(y)_i,(y)_{i+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\ \\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(y)_0=\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(\\operatorname{Init}(e,\\vec x))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{Len}(y)-1\\ \\operatorname{CStep}(e,(y)_i,(y)_{i+1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原参数顺序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y,e,\\vec x)\">\\((y,e,\\vec x)\\)</span>。历史的项是自然数配置码，而不是直接属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}\\)</span> 的配置三元组；解码只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{CCode}\\)</span> 检查之后使用。此谓词不要求末态停机，长度为一的合法初态历史也可满足它。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-compcode-—-Computation-Code-($\\mathrm{CompCode}$)","text":"df-compcode — Computation Code ($\\mathrm{CompCode}$)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-machine-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"4293e1643a9254d8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,y\\in\\mathbb N$、$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；数值序列操作见 [[90-df-sequence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}$ 全部取 [[90-df-machine-coding]]；配置对象见 [[90-df-configuration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}$ 全部取 [[90-df-machine-coding]]；配置对象见 [[90-df-configuration]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCode}","display":false},{"tex":"e,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\operatorname{Seq}(y)\\land\\operatorname{Len}(y)>0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{Len}(y)\\ \\operatorname{CCode}(e,(y)_i)\\\\\n&\\land(y)_0=\\operatorname{EncConf}_e(\\operatorname{Init}(e,\\vec x))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{Len}(y)-1\\ \\operatorname{CStep}(e,(y)_i,(y)_{i+1}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(y,e,\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_{M_e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CCode}","display":false}],"bytes":1339,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea8ec37142a5e9b6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-compcode]]: 检查计算历史中的配置"},{"id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$e,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；计算历史与终止历史分别见 [[90-df-compcode]]、[[90-df-haltseq]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-compcode]]、[[90-df-haltseq]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]